{"ref":"character:imelda-belpaese","lead":[{"k":"p","c":["Imelda Belpaese is a playable character from the base game version of Vampire Survivors. Her starting weapon is ",{"i":"Sprite-Magic_Wand.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:magic-wand"}," ",{"t":"Magic Wand","r":"weapon:magic-wand"},"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Character","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["27 October 2021 (Update)"]]},{"label":"Alias","cells":[["Imelda"]]},{"label":"Character ID","cells":[["IMELDA"]]},{"label":"Skin ID","cells":[["DEFAULT"]]},{"label":"Starting weapon","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Magic_Wand.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"weapon:magic-wand"}," ",{"t":"Magic Wand","r":"weapon:magic-wand"}]]},{"label":"Unlocked by","cells":[["Available by default."]]},{"label":"Cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 10"]]},{"label":"Secret","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Ignores walls","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Theme","cells":[["No"]]}]},{"title":"Initial stats","rows":[{"label":"Max Health","cells":[["100"]]},{"label":"Move Speed","cells":[["-"]]},{"label":"Speed","cells":[["-"]]},{"label":"Cooldown","cells":[["-"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"unlocking","title":"Unlocking","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["She is unlocked by default. She needs to be purchased for ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 10, which scales with other characters purchased."]}],"subs":[{"id":"unlocking-unblinded-imelda-belpaese","title":"Unblinded Imelda Belpaese","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Completing the Adventure World of Light and Dark for the first time unlocks an alternative ",{"t":"skin","r":"relic:mindbender"}," named Unblinded Imelda Belpaese."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alternatively, Unblinded Imelda can be unlocked in the ",{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," by casting the spell \"unblindimelda\"."]}]}]},{"id":"passive-bonuses","title":"Passive bonuses","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Imelda gains +10% ",{"i":"Sprite-Growth.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:growth"}," ",{"t":"Growth","r":"powerup:growth"}," every 5 levels until level 15. The maximum Growth gained this way is +30%."]},{"k":"p","c":["The following table shows how much Growth she gains by level:"]},{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Levels"],"h":1},{"c":["Growth"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":["1-4"]},{"c":["0%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["5-9"]},{"c":["+10%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["10-14"]},{"c":["+20%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["15+"]},{"c":["+30%"]}]}]}],"subs":[{"id":"passive-bonuses-unblinded-imelda-belpaese","title":"Unblinded Imelda Belpaese","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Compared to Imelda, Unblinded Imelda starts with +40% ",{"i":"Sprite-Speed.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:speed"}," ",{"t":"Speed","r":"powerup:speed"},", +40% ",{"i":"Sprite-Move_Speed.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:move-speed"}," ",{"t":"Move Speed","r":"powerup:move-speed"},", and -10% ",{"i":"Sprite-Cooldown.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:cooldown"}," ",{"t":"Cooldown","r":"powerup:cooldown"},". She also starts with a level 5 ",{"i":"Sprite-Empty_Tome.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:empty-tome"}," ",{"t":"Empty Tome","r":"passive:empty-tome"},"."]}]}]},{"id":"tips","title":"Tips","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["As there is no further benefit to gaining levels beyond Level 15, Imelda can very early on make effective use of the ",{"i":"Sprite-Game_Killer_(0).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"weapon:game-killer-0"}," ",{"t":"Game Killer (0)","r":"weapon:game-killer-0"}," Arcana. This is double-effective, as Imelda's passive boost also increases the damage of the Arcana."]},{"c":["Imelda can make use of ",{"i":"Sprite-Wind_Whip.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:wind-whip"}," ",{"t":"Wind Whip","r":"weapon:wind-whip"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Vol_Luminatio.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:vol-luminatio"}," ",{"t":"Vol Luminatio","r":"weapon:vol-luminatio"}," early on, since they grow stronger with extra Growth."]}]}],"subs":[]},